2   2000
3    380
4     63
5     58
6     35
7   2000
8   1000
9     34
10    27
11    33
12    32
13    26
14  1000
```

100, 2000, and 380 are special values, I want to count and label contiguous "Sets" of these  values, and get this:

```
   Block Set
1   1000   1
2   2000   1
3    380   1
4     60   0
5     50   0
6     47   0
7   2000   2
8   1000   2
